    {
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "prometheus"
      },
      "description": "5xx 占全部请求的百分比（5 分钟窗口）。本项目 5xx 的常见来源有三个：① 网关撤销校验 fail-closed 返回 503（Redis 查不通，绝不放行已撤销令牌）；② 下游实例缺失（没注册进 Nacos）；③ 服务自身未捕获异常。定位一律先取响应体里的 traceId，不要靠猜。",
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "color": {
            "mode": "thresholds"
          },
          "decimals": 2,
          "mappings": [],
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              {
                "color": "green",
                "value": null
              },
              {
                "color": "yellow",
                "value": 0.5
              },
              {
                "color": "red",
                "value": 2
              }
            ]
          },
          "unit": "percent"
        },
